The vendored SDK exposes create, delete through
service work requests; the runtime polls those
requests and preserves the tracked resource
identity before rereading OCI.
Parent identifiers scope composite OCI request
paths and remain replacement-only unless the SDK
update details explicitly expose them.
Create, get, list where available, update, and
delete request shapes are exercised by the
package-local typed OCI mock integration test.
